    "id": "alvarez-agent",
    "name": "Professor Alvarez"
   }
  ],
  "text": "Hello Professor Alvarez.\n\nI hold the official schedule for next week only — that is the week of Monday 23 to Friday 27 November. The week of Monday 30 November is not in my hands yet, so I cannot confirm anything for Tuesday 1 December, and I would rather not guess.\n\nTwo things I cannot do in any case: I do not have your private appointments, and I do not book or check meetings for other people — a time is taken only when it is on your own calendar.\n\nIf it is next week's list you want resent, say the word and I will send it. For the week of 30 November, please ask me again once that week's schedule is out.",
